+  // Notify BTA as well because properties are otherwise consumed only at stream start.
+  // BTA owns active-session, feature and duplicate-mode checks. The API boundary keeps
+  // BTIF independent of BTA internals.
+  BTA_AvUpdateAptxAdaptiveMode();
